# Web UI

- Keep the obsidian and jade palette, IBM Plex via `@fontsource`, and a visible focus style.
- The shell needs a skip link, a collapsible sidebar, a drawer below 768px, Escape to close, and `aria-current` on the active item.
- Market prices come from the API. If the request fails, show an error. Do not invent client-side prices.
- The synthetic-sample banner and the not-enforced stops warning stay visible.
- Research and Audit are real pages. Do not disable those links.
- Do not copy the 21st.dev Dashboard Shell. It was inspected and rejected.
